, at $189 each = $567. The DK-200 was in stock, so I didn't need the DK-210.\n- 3 \u00d7 MN-32 32-inch 5K Monitor, new, at $529 each = $1,587.\n- **Total: $2,154.**\n\nThe total is under the $2,500 manager-approval limit, but the system still sent the order to a person for review. It was approved with the note \"Looks right.\" Everything on the order is new, not refurbished.", "type": "text"}]}]}